                  "content": {
                    "title": "Summer plans",
                    "dialogue": [
                      {
                        "speaker": "Sam",
                        "text": "Right, that's the last box. The van's leaving at twelve."
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker": "Priya",
                        "text": "What time are you meeting the band in London?"
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker": "Sam",
                        "text": "We're meeting at the studio at five. We're starting the recording on Monday."
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker": "Lucía",
                        "text": "Are you going to visit us at Christmas?"
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker": "Sam",
                        "text": "Definitely. And I'll be back for Priya's birthday too, I promise."
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker": "Daniel",
                        "text": "And what about you two? Any summer plans, Priya?"
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker": "Priya",
                        "text": "I'm working most of August. But I might go to Cornwall for a few days."
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker": "Lucía",
                        "text": "And we're flying to Valencia on the fifteenth. Daniel is meeting my parents!"
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker": "Sam",
                        "text": "Ha! Is he nervous?"
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker": "Daniel",
                        "text": "Nervous? Me? Maybe a bit. I think they'll like me. I might cook them an Irish stew."
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker": "Lucía",
                        "text": "In August? In Valencia? You might die of heat!"
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker": "Ollie",
                        "text": "Hi, everyone! I'm moving in a bit early. Is that OK?"
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker": "Sam",
                        "text": "Perfect timing. Look after my room, mate. And look after these two."
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker": "Ollie",
                        "text": "I will. Good luck in London!"
                      }
                    ],
                    "passage": "August. It's Sam's last day at Clifton Road. There's a van outside, and everyone is helping him to carry boxes."
